# v1.5.0 (S15.0): Write panel: white panel, black DU ink, undo / clear, insert as SVG + strokes.
copy-notes tests/test-notes/_test
shot v1.5.0-before-write
tap-on Write
shot v1.5.0-panel-empty
press-on InkArea
move 500 1500
move 700 1400
move 900 1560
release
wait 700
shot v1.5.0-panel-ink
tap-on Clear
shot v1.5.0-panel-cleared
tap-on Undo
tap-on Insert
expect ![ink](.ink/
shot v1.5.0-after-insert
tap-on Options
tap-on Keyboard & input
shot v1.5.0-settings-handwriting
tap-on Close
